      "refersTo": "button-demo-sheet",
      "description": "Bundled sample interaction; product service is not invoked.",
      "html": "<button class=\"ds-demo-sheet\" type=\"button\">Compare the sample<svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.65\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 12h14m-5-5 5 5-5 5\"/></svg></button>",
      "css": ".ds-demo-sheet{font-family:var(--font,Manrope,'PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:9px;min-height:44px;width:100%;font-size:12px;font-weight:650;border:0;border-radius:12px;background:var(--mint-wash,#e3f1ec);color:var(--mint,#0f766e);cursor:pointer}.ds-demo-sheet svg{width:16px;height:16px}.ds-demo-sheet:hover{background:var(--mint-wash,#e3f1ec)}.ds-demo-sheet:focus-visible{outline:3px solid var(--blue,#145bdd);outline-offset:5px}"
