      "refersTo": "navigation",
      "description": "Glass navigation with simple links; header controls are separate primitives.",
      "html": "<nav class=\"ds-nav\" aria-label=\"Main navigation\"><a href=\"/#products\">Products</a><a href=\"/about/\">About</a></nav>",
      "css": ".ds-nav{box-sizing:border-box;font-family:var(--font,Manrope,'PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif);display:flex;gap:30px;align-items:center;height:68px;padding:0 22px;border-radius:22px;background:var(--glass,rgba(255,255,255,.74));backdrop-filter:blur(24px) saturate(145%);box-shadow:0 8px 32px -18px rgba(28,48,80,.26)}.ds-nav a{display:flex;align-items:center;min-height:44px;font-size:14px;font-weight:600;text-decoration:none;color:var(--ink,#182334)}.ds-nav a:hover{color:var(--blue,#145bdd)}.ds-nav a:focus-visible{outline:3px solid var(--blue,#145bdd);outline-offset:5px}@media(max-width:600px){.ds-nav{height:62px;padding:0 13px;border-radius:20px}.ds-nav a{font-size:12px}.ds-nav a:nth-child(2){display:none}}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Product app dock",
      "kind": "custom",
      "refersTo": "app-dock",
      "description": "Selected/unselected dock styling; the application script supplies tab switching.",
      "html": "<div class=\"ds-dock\" role=\"tablist\" aria-label=\"Choose a product preview\"><button type=\"button\" role=\"tab\" aria-selected=\"true\" tabindex=\"0\"><span class=\"ds-app ds-answer\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.4\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M12 6c-3-2-6-2-9-1v14c3-1 6-1 9 1 3-2 6-2 9-1V5c-3-1-6-1-9 1Zm0 0v14\"/></svg></span><span>Answer Book</span></button><button type=\"button\" role=\"tab\" aria-selected=\"false\" tabindex=\"-1\"><span class=\"ds-app ds-sheet\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.4\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect x=\"3\" y=\"3\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" rx=\"3\"/><path d=\"M3 9h18M9 3v18m0-6h12m-6-6v12\"/></svg></span><span>SheetDelta</span></button><button type=\"button\" role=\"tab\" aria-selected=\"false\" tabindex=\"-1\"><span class=\"ds-app ds-lens\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.4\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect x=\"3\" y=\"3\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" rx=\"4\"/><circle cx=\"13\" cy=\"13\" r=\"5\"/><path d=\"m17 17 4 4M7 7h6\"/></svg></span><span>ShipLens</span></button></div>",
      "css": ".ds-dock{font-family:var(--font,Manrope,'PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif);display:flex;justify-content:center;gap:3px;padding:9px 12px;width:fit-content;max-width:100%;border-radius:25px;background:var(--glass,rgba(255,255,255,.74));backdrop-filter:blur(20px);box-shadow:0 18px 32px -20px rgba(32,58,91,.42)}.ds-dock button{box-sizing:border-box;font-family:var(--font,Manrope,'PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif);width:110px;padding:7px 8px 4px;border:0;background:transparent;display:flex;align-items:center;flex-direction:column;gap:7px;color:var(--muted,#5c6879);font-size:11px;font-weight:600;border-radius:16px;cursor:pointer}.ds-dock button[aria-selected=true]{color:var(--ink,#182334);background:var(--paper,#fff)}.ds-app{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;width:48px;height:48px;border-radius:14px;color:#fff;box-shadow:inset 0 1px 1px rgba(255,255,255,.6),inset 0 -5px 10px rgba(0,0,0,.12)}.ds-app svg{width:27px;height:27px}.ds-answer{background:linear-gradient(150deg,#629eff,#235dd9)}.ds-sheet{background:linear-gradient(150deg,#4fc9a5,#087862)}.ds-lens{background:linear-gradient(150deg,#ffa17e,#cb5234)}.ds-dock .ds-app{transition:transform .32s var(--ease,cubic-bezier(.16,1,.3,1))}.ds-dock button:hover .ds-app{transform:translateY(-3px)}.ds-dock button:focus-visible{outline:3px solid var(--blue,#145bdd);outline-offset:5px}@media(max-width:600px){.ds-dock{padding:7px 8px;border-radius:23px}.ds-dock button{width:89px;padding-inline:5px}.ds-dock .ds-app{width:46px;height:46px}}@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){.ds-dock .ds-app{transition:none}.ds-dock button:hover .ds-app{transform:none}}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Related product",
      "kind": "card",
      "refersTo": "related-card",
      "description": "Compact link on product detail pages.",
      "html": "<a class=\"ds-related\" href=\"/products/answer/\"><span class=\"ds-app ds-answer\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.4\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M12 6c-3-2-6-2-9-1v14c3-1 6-1 9 1 3-2 6-2 9-1V5c-3-1-6-1-9 1Zm0 0v14\"/></svg></span><span>One Page Answer<small>For a little clarity</small></span><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.65\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 12h14m-5-5 5 5-5 5\"/></svg></a>",
      "css": ".ds-related{font-family:var(--font,Manrope,'PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif);display:flex;align-items:center;gap:18px;padding:18px 22px;border-radius:18px;background:var(--paper,#fff);color:var(--ink,#182334);text-decoration:none;font-size:17px;font-weight:650}.ds-app{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;width:48px;height:48px;border-radius:14px;color:#fff;box-shadow:inset 0 1px 1px rgba(255,255,255,.6),inset 0 -5px 10px rgba(0,0,0,.12)}.ds-app svg{width:27px;height:27px}.ds-answer{background:linear-gradient(150deg,#629eff,#235dd9)}.ds-sheet{background:linear-gradient(150deg,#4fc9a5,#087862)}.ds-lens{background:linear-gradient(150deg,#ffa17e,#cb5234)}.ds-related .ds-app{width:45px;height:45px}.ds-related .ds-app svg{width:25px;height:25px}.ds-related small{display:block;color:var(--muted,#5c6879);font-size:11px;font-weight:400;margin-top:4px}.ds-related>svg{width:22px;height:22px;margin-left:auto}.ds-related:hover{text-decoration:none}.ds-related:focus-visible{outline:3px solid var(--blue,#145bdd);outline-offset:5px}@media(max-width:600px){.ds-related{padding:17px;font-size:15px}}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Flat answer cover",
      "kind": "custom",
      "refersTo": "book-cover",
      "description": "Decorative CSS cover artwork, not a physical book mockup.",
      "html": "<div class=\"ds-cover\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span>ONE PAGE ANSWER</span><strong>The<br>Answer<br>Book</strong><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.65\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"4\"/><path d=\"M12 2v2m0 16v2M2 12h2m16 0h2M5 5l1.5 1.5m11 11L19 19M5 19l1.5-1.5m11-11L19 5\"/></svg><small>A LITTLE CLARITY</small></div>",
      "css": ".ds-cover{box-sizing:border-box;font-family:var(--font,Manrope,'PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif);background:linear-gradient(125deg,#2861be,#164394);width:215px;height:288px;transform:rotate(-6deg);border-radius:20px;display:flex;align-items:center;flex-direction:column;color:#ecf3ff;padding:29px 26px 20px;position:relative}.ds-cover>span{font-size:11px;letter-spacing:.12em}.ds-cover strong{font-family:Georgia,\"Songti SC\",serif;font-size:35px;font-weight:400;line-height:1.05;text-align:center;margin:25px 0 18px}.ds-cover>svg{width:30px;height:30px;color:#d4c69c}.ds-cover small{margin-top:auto;font-size:11px;letter-spacing:.08em}"
    }
  ],
  "narrative": {
    "northStar": "The iOS App Switcher",
    "overview": "Nimokit uses the confirmed iOS-inspired direction: cool porcelain, clear ink, rounded app objects and translucent navigation. Manrope gives the interface a compact modern voice; the system font fallbacks keep Chinese content native and readable. Generous space and a restrained three-color palette let the products remain distinct.\n\nDepth belongs to the app surfaces and their surrounding atmosphere. Product illustrations are original HTML/CSS and inline SVG. The blue answer-book artwork is a flat cover graphic with a simple rotation; it has no simulated page edges, spine or physical perspective. No raster imagery ships in this implementation.",
    "keyCharacteristics": [
      "Cool porcelain and ink with blue, mint and coral product accents.",
      "Translucent navigation and app dock; soft layered preview surfaces.",
      "Rounded geometry, clear type hierarchy and generous responsive spacing.",
      "Local licensed Manrope with Chinese system-font fallbacks.",
      "Keyboard-visible focus, bilingual routes, light/dark appearance and reduced-motion support."
    ],
    "rules": [],
    "dos": [
      "Do use the existing semantic CSS variables so surfaces and text follow the active theme.",
      "Do preserve blue, mint and coral as the three product identities.",
      "Do keep product names as real h3 headings, with promotional supporting copy in paragraphs.",
      "Do retain at least 44px targets for the navigation, icon, demo and text-link controls documented here.",
      "Do label sample data and capability illustrations; the homepage demos use bundled sample content.",
      "Do keep the answer-book illustration a flat CSS cover graphic and retain the shipped font license."
    ],
    "donts": [
      "Don't replace the confirmed cool iOS-inspired visual vocabulary with an unrelated aesthetic.",
      "Don't turn every section into a bordered card; use the implemented whitespace and alternating product rows.",
      "Don't add a physical book spine, page-edge shading or perspective to the flat cover illustration.",
      "Don't apply dark-theme link blue to primary-button backgrounds; primary buttons retain their fixed blue fill and white text.",
      "Don't add invented testimonials, metrics, inputs, payment states or unsupported product promises.",
      "Don't remove the reduced-motion behavior, visible focus treatment or meaningful heading structure."
    ]
  }
}
